Z||000004||Coupe'N||07-01-2001||02:47 PM||||I have a 87' coupe with the DUAL side exit exhaust. Even though I only have a 4 cylinder duke engine, I ran the exhaust through the down pipe to a Hi-Flow muffler (dyno-something) and had it exit before the rear wheels on each side of the car. I didn't have any sort of nice tips on it, but polished the heck outta the tailpipe ends to make em' shiny! hehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Here is a pic, even though its dirty at the time of the pic...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BroCarsExhaust_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
